#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:5 5223ae81b9e24f13a69d6cf57cd4d425
msgid "ROS 1 / ROS 2"
msgstr "ROS 1 / ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:10 7a7e3213f61d497cb65afcf8c2cb7766
msgid ""
"ArduPilot capabilities can be extended with `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ "
"(aka Robot Operating System)."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的功能可通过 `ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__（即机器人操作系统）进行扩展。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:12 42731b4a059c4b05ba1183b7a6fcf808
msgid ""
"`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ provides libraries, tools, hardware "
"abstraction, device drivers, visualizers, message-passing, package "
"management, and more to help software developers create robot applications. "
"ROS1 is being replaced by `ROS 2 "
"<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`ROS <http://www.ros.org/>`__ "
"提供库、工具、硬件抽象、设备驱动、可视化工具、消息传递、包管理等功能，帮助软件开发者创建机器人应用程序。ROS1 正逐渐被 `ROS 2 "
"<http://design.ros2.org/articles/why_ros2.html>`__ 取代。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:19 ba3b88b1948e44b2a50daeac193290f9
msgid ""
"The tutorials below are split between ROS 1 and ROS 2. If you aren't sure "
"which version to use, the ArduPilot development team recommends ROS 2 "
"because ROS 1 is end-of-life in 2025."
msgstr ""
"以下教程分为 ROS 1 和 ROS 2 两部分。若不确定使用哪个版本，ArduPilot 开发团队推荐使用 ROS 2，因为 ROS 1 将于 "
"2025 年停止维护。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:23 27c4f1e0d7144218860e7d5075c7b22e
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:25 199b19084e9b409fa2c1c92a5877b845
msgid ""
"Before using ArduPilot with ROS, you should first be familiar with both "
"ArduPilot and ROS before trying to integrate them together."
msgstr "在将 ArduPilot 与 ROS 结合使用之前，应先分别熟悉 ArduPilot 和 ROS，再尝试将二者集成。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:27 8f84150963274cfd9b308ab7f2deaba9
msgid ""
"Learn how to use ArduPilot first by following the relevant wiki for `Rover "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__, `Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ or `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__. In particular, make sure the "
"vehicle works well in Manual and Autonomous modes like Guided and Auto "
"before trying to use ROS."
msgstr ""
"首先通过相关 wiki 学习 ArduPilot 的使用方法：`Rover "
"<https://ardupilot.org/rover/index.html>`__、`Copter "
"<https://ardupilot.org/copter/index.html>`__ 或 `Plane "
"<https://ardupilot.org/plane/index.html>`__。特别是要确保飞行器在 Manual 和 Guided、Auto "
"等自主模式下工作正常，然后再尝试使用 ROS。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:28 810cb6c601c444ac8f02f7ca34a88c23
msgid ""
"Learn how to use ROS by reading the `ROS 1 tutorials "
"<http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials>`__ or the `ROS 2 tutorials "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html#>`__.  In the case of a "
"problem with ROS, it is best to ask on ROS community forums or `Robotics "
"Stack Exchange <https://robotics.stackexchange.com/>`__ first (or google "
"your error). You will find many other tutorials about ROS like `Emlid "
"<https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/ros>`__."
msgstr ""
"通过阅读 `ROS 1 教程 <http://wiki.ros.org/ROS/Tutorials>`__ 或 `ROS 2 教程 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials.html#>`__ 学习 ROS 的使用方法。遇到 ROS "
"问题时，最好先在 ROS 社区论坛或 `Robotics Stack Exchange "
"<https://robotics.stackexchange.com/>`__ 上提问（或搜索错误信息）。您还可以找到很多其他 ROS 教程，例如 "
"`Emlid <https://docs.emlid.com/navio2/ros>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:31 ac67d36adfee461699466f743e125c52
msgid "MAVROS"
msgstr "MAVROS"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:33 eb629551544641448d7a60cabed4bdaf
msgid ""
"`MAVROS <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__ is a ROS package that can convert "
"between ROS topics and `MAVLink messages "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink>`__ allowing ArduPilot vehicles to "
"communicate with ROS. The `MAVROS code can be found here "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/mavros/tree/master/mavros>`__. Starting in "
"ArduPilot 4.5, ArduPilot supports a direct DDS interface compatible with ROS"
" 2, which removes the need to use MAVROS for certain applications."
msgstr ""
"`MAVROS <http://wiki.ros.org/mavros>`__ 是一个 ROS 软件包，可在 ROS 话题和 `MAVLink 消息 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink>`__ 之间进行转换，使 ArduPilot 飞行器能够与 ROS "
"通信。`MAVROS 代码可在此处查看 "
"<https://github.com/mavlink/mavros/tree/master/mavros>`__。自 ArduPilot 4.5 "
"起，ArduPilot 支持与 ROS 2 兼容的直接 DDS 接口，使部分应用场景无需再使用 MAVROS。"

