#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:77 963fcd2639784e07b02395ce15bb685a
msgid ""
"ROS is capable of extending autopilot capabilities with a wider ecosystem of"
" technologies that can run on more powerful computers."
msgstr "ROS 能够借助可在更强大计算机上运行的更广泛技术生态系统来扩展自驾仪的功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:79 6565a277154445e9a3027fdc0912e03d
msgid ""
"Here is ArduPilot Rover performing path planning around objects using ROS "
"navigation."
msgstr "以下展示了 ArduPilot Rover 使用 ROS 导航模块进行绕障路径规划的示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros.rst:84 a6ac2fd8bb7f467195e22572a49827ee
msgid ""
"We are keen to improve ArduPilot's support of ROS so if you find issues "
"(such as commands that do not seem to be supported), please report them in "
"the `ArduPilot issues list "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ with a title that "
"includes \"ROS\" and we will attempt to resolve them as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们致力于改进 ArduPilot 对 ROS 的支持，如果您发现任何问题（例如某些命令似乎不受支持），请在 `ArduPilot issues "
"list <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues>`__ "
"中提交，标题中包含「ROS」，我们将尽快解决。"
